{'symbol': 'HRL', 'date': '2023-05-22 17:00:00', 'title': 'HORMEL FOODS CORPORATION DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'AUSTIN, MINN. , MAY 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HORMEL FOODS CORPORATION (NYSE: HRL), A FORTUNE 500 GLOBAL BRANDED FOOD COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS QUARTERLY DIVIDEND ON THE COMMON STOCK, AUTHORIZED BY THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS AT\xa027.5 CENTS\xa0($0.275)\xa0A SHARE ON\xa0MAY 22, 2023, WILL BE PAID\xa0AUGUST 15, 2023, TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0JULY 17, 2023.'}